cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or its results in published work, please cite the
  relevant version below AND the underlying physics references listed at
  the bottom. See docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for the full list of observational
  data sources used and how to cite them. v0.3-prelim+T71.5 (T71.5
  Tier B closure 2026-08-28: Drobczyk quantitative χ² test added
  (t68b, χ²=213.62, strong tension vs arXiv:2506.22997); LZ WS2024
  stale-claim correction (already in production since R12 via
  t30_lz_real_posterior.loglike_lz_real, HEPData 155182, 26 mass points);
  KiSS-SIDM UFD fidelity deferred with rationale (T38a hit 1-hour Julia
  timeout at N=5e4; canonical halo converged at N=1e4-1e5). V0_6_ROADMAP:
  7 of 15 items shipped across T71.2 → T71.5. Earlier closed rounds:
  T71.4 (3 v0.6 items in parallel: hier-sparc +0.10 log Z, bullet_sens
  +1.74 log Z, CHANNEL_STATUS dict); T71.3 (R7 closure: nlive=2000
  (Nc,Nf) scan via 7-way parallel background runner, scan converged);
  T71.2 (R16 closure: ksfr_mask_max_at_runtime field + config_hash field,
  575/0/6 tests); T71.1 (R15 closure: inelastic + nlive=2000 + KSFR mask
  extension confound found) and the H3+H4 sensitivity report at
  v0.3-prelim/docs/H3_H4_SENSITIVITY_REPORT.md are the most recent
  closed rounds at the time of the most recent public release.
